# --- Rust ---
# Lockfiles aren't committed yet — no Rust toolchain is available in this
# dev environment to generate one correctly; CI generates it fresh each
# run. Commit Cargo.lock (workspace root only) once a toolchain is
# available locally to produce and review it — see phases/reports/PHASE-01.md.
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock

# --- Go ---
# Same reasoning as Cargo.lock above: no local Go toolchain to generate
# go.sum correctly; CI runs `go mod tidy` fresh each run instead.
go.sum
/bin/
*.exe
*.test

